		<h2> 
			Evaluation Policy
		</h2> 
		<ol> 
			<li> 
				Final exam (40%) , Wednesday, June. 30, 2021.
			</li> 
			<li> 
				Mid-term presentation (10%), deadline on April 28, 2021.
				Template of midterm reports in PPT can be downloaded here.

				must submit the topic to TA and presentation time for confirmation by Sept. 27, 2016.

				TA and the teacher may suggest changes to the topics.

				must confirm the topics and presentation schedule by Oct. 4, 2018.

				must turn in the report in PowerPoint format, at least 15 pages, to the TA via email.

				must make a presentation in front of the class for 10 mins.

				The presentation dates can be on April 28, 2021 and May 12, 2021.   

				The topic must be technologically related to one of the chapter in the textbook.

				a main paper

				must be a regular paper published in ACM/IEEE ICSE 2019-20, ACM FSE 2019-20, IEEE ASE 2019-20, ACM ISSTA 2019-20, or ACM PLDI 2019-20. 

				2 comparison papers

				Comparing the three papers that you selected in the above.

				The report must be in English and is evaluated as follows.

				20% on background before the work.

				20% on the motivation.

				20% Techniques of the work.

				20% Experiment interpretation.

				20% Writing. 
			</li> 
